<title>SPAIN: Pryca gross sales in 1996 down 0.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Pryca gross sales in 1996 down 0.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket Pryca said on Tuesday gross group sales in 1996 were 594.5 billion pesetas, down 0.9 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>In a statement it added that sales in December alone totalled 75.70 billion pesetas. November sales were 48.32 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
